%% Cart and checkout flow
%% Status: current | Related: apps/api/src/routes/orders.routes.js
flowchart LR
  Browse[Catalog / supplier products] --> Cart[Cart lines]
  Cart --> QL[Optional: quick list\nscheduled or manual]
  QL --> Checkout[Checkout — pricing, deals redeem]
  Checkout --> Limit{orders_per_day meter}
  Limit -->|allowed| Place[POST place order\ncustomer_order PLACED]
  Limit -->|blocked| Modal[403 LIMIT_EXCEEDED\nUpgradeModal]
  Place --> Notify[Notify supplier team]
  Place --> WH{Supplier multi-warehouse?}
  WH -->|yes| Assign[assignWarehousesToOrder]
  WH -->|no| DefaultWH[default warehouse path]
